{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北角發現「毒品快餐車」。昨晚（17日）9時許，警方接獲途人報案指，見到一輛私家車泊在丹拿道18號對開，懷疑車上有兩人吸毒。警員到場調查，發現懷疑毒品，當場拘捕兩人，警方將案件列作「販運危險藥物」，通知緝毒犬到場搜車，正點算毒品重量和價值。</p><p>根據網上圖片，其中一張圖片顯示警方將其中一人按地制服，其餘照片顯示總共有兩人雙手被手銬反鎖，其中一人黑布蒙頭，警方封鎖現場調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方將其中一人按地制服。（Facebook群組「北角有樂」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199532875717021696704596.jpeg/FbcUiygr6SjS0FGugUqpnaoHsUy0lvppcOUIfXDlCH0\"/><figcaption>警方將其中一人按地制服。（Facebook群組「北角有樂」圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"其中一人黑布蒙頭。（Facebook群組「北角有樂」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199532873309360128296743.jpeg/fvo7qBd0i2ViU7Dd1kyJwbJb73yRMIfmbxSgjG8UoIw\"/><figcaption>其中一人黑布蒙頭。（Facebook群組「北角有樂」圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"總共有兩人雙手被手銬反鎖。（Facebook群組「北角有樂」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199532870700371968584192.jpeg/8PARKtGdkGuUByX-U86GMzljj37WWilydPh_VnT4f1Y\"/><figcaption>總共有兩人雙手被手銬反鎖。（Facebook群組「北角有樂」圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T17:58:27.484894+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T17:39:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:12:01.465298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T17:51:47.199183+00:00","content_hash":"d77b6d48252ce61fb0464dbfbe670589d9af87b552601dd80a09211f6599538f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}